    title: "Qatari delegation visits Tehran for talks, Iran says",
    summary: "Qatari delegation visits Tehran for talks, Iran says A Qatari delegation held talks in Tehran on Friday night, an Iranian official said, as diplomatic efforts continued to end the war triggered by US and Israeli attacks on Iran in February. Iranian Deputy Foreign Minister Kazem Gharibabadi said Tehran remained in contact with mediators, including Qatar, which has long used its ties with both Iran and the United States to help facilitate dialogue in regional disputes. \"We are in contact with mediators, including the Qataris, both in person and virtually, and are holding the necessary discussions to see whether another opportunity can be given to diplomacy,\" Gharibabadi said, according to the semi-official Tasnim news agency.",
    preview: "Qatari delegation visits Tehran for talks, Iran says A Qatari delegation held talks in Tehran on Friday night, an Iranian official said, as diplomatic efforts continued to end the war triggered by US and Israeli attacks on Iran in February. Iranian Deputy Foreign Minister Kazem Gharibabadi said Tehran remained in contact with mediators, including Qatar, which has long used its ties with both Iran and the United States to help facilitate dialogue in regional disputes.",
    body: "Qatari delegation visits Tehran for talks, Iran says A Qatari delegation held talks in Tehran on Friday night, an Iranian official said, as diplomatic efforts continued to end the war triggered by US and Israeli attacks on Iran in February. Iranian Deputy Foreign Minister Kazem Gharibabadi said Tehran remained in contact with mediators, including Qatar, which has long used its ties with both Iran and the United States to help facilitate dialogue in regional disputes.\n\n\"We are in contact with mediators, including the Qataris, both in person and virtually, and are holding the necessary discussions to see whether another opportunity can be given to diplomacy,\" Gharibabadi said, according to the semi-official Tasnim news agency.",
